    "title": "Deep Learning-Based Early Detection of Plant Diseases Using Multispectral Imaging",
    "abstract": "This research develops an advanced deep learning system for early detection of plant diseases using multispectral imaging technology. The project combines computer vision and machine learning to identify plant pathogens before visible symptoms appear.",
    "description": "The project utilizes a custom-designed CNN architecture optimized for multispectral image analysis. We're collecting data from various agricultural settings using specialized multispectral cameras that capture both visible and near-infrared spectral bands. The system will be trained on a diverse dataset of healthy and infected plants, focusing on major crops in Bangladesh.",
    "field": "Computer Vision & Machine Learning",
    "keywords": [
      "Deep Learning",
      "Agriculture",
      "Computer Vision",
      "Multispectral Imaging",
      "Plant Pathology"
    ],
